<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Days.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "900" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\登山月.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Our rescue turned out to be a bigger production than I'd thought.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\バギーアイドリング.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\バギー整列.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Not only had they put up a ladder, every buggy in the settlement had been sent out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎腰に手.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, well, you've all had a rough time. I'm sorry my </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> dragged you into this."</STYLE><PG>
This was the prime suspect, <STYLE ID="1">Kotaro Niimura</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He really did look just like <STYLE ID="3">Haruka's dad</STYLE>, whom I'd seen in the memorial photo.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬腰に手.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Ohoho, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">! That's one more good experience under your belt!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Obasan</STYLE> was as energetic as ever...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\城崎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"All right, then, let's give these young ladies a ride to the Niimura house! 
{PAUSE ""}
　Oh, and I haven't had a drink yet today!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This man of about 50 was apparently named <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="しろざき">Shirozaki</STYLE>-san.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He wasn't directly related to the Niimura family, apparently, but came from a family line that went back a long way in the settlement.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2,人物3" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
From here on, they would take us riding double.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE> rode with <STYLE ID="4">Obasan</STYLE>, 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE> with <STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE>, 
{PAUSE ""}
and I climbed onto the buggy <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="しろざき">Shirozaki</STYLE>-san was driving.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE> were apparently walking home from here.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手を上げる.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"All right! Then it's a race to see who reaches the finish first, me or the buggies!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! We've got guests aboard, so we're driving safely over here!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE> scolded <STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE>, but she'd already taken off running.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬腰に手バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"The roads are bad today, so hold on tight to your driver!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When <STYLE ID="4">Obasan</STYLE> called out, the buggies all set off at once.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "1000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\バギー運転中.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "900" "1000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\惑星宝石箱.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\バギー正面.gal" "NORMAL" "30" "1000" "480" "270" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{QUAKE "000" "QUAKE" "1" "3" "3" "0" "30"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Shrugging off the rain-soaked mud, the buggy moved nimbly along.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Every time we went through a big puddle, muddy water sprayed up spectacularly, and it felt amazing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was my first time riding a buggy, but the springs on the tires? Or rather the cushioning worked better than I'd expected, so the ride wasn't bad even on the rough road.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was like being on an amusement park ride, and pretty fun.<PG>
"Um, <STYLE ID="9">Natsumi-chan</STYLE>, was it!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6" RUBY="しろざき">Shirozaki</STYLE>-san called out to me loudly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Yes! </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">'s childhood friend, Natsumi Kogori!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I answered loudly too, so as not to lose to the buggy's engine.<PG>
"Boy, you ran into some real trouble right after getting here! 
{PAUSE ""}
　But the settlement has proper electricity and running water, so you'll be fine!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Really!? I'd gone and imagined somewhere a lot less convenient!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Up until a few years ago, cell phones didn't even work, though! 
{PAUSE ""}
　But <STYLE ID="10">Grand Witch-sama</STYLE>―
{PAUSE ""}
um, the <STYLE ID="10">elder</STYLE> here has been changing all sorts of things!"<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Uh... Aren't there any mysterious things in a settlement like this!? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　Like ghosts showing up!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ghosts, huh! When I was a kid, I used to do tests of courage and such with the other boys, but we'd almost always run into animals partway through, and before we knew it, it'd turned into a hunting contest!"<PG>
Hunting?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Looking for the small contradictions <STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE> had mentioned earlier.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could I draw some contradiction out of <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="しろざき">Shirozaki</STYLE>-san here?<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"How do you hunt!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Adults use guns! Kids use homemade bows and arrows! 
{PAUSE ""}
　Nowadays nobody uses bows and arrows anymore, though!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Then how do people like </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> hunt!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now, how will he answer...!?<PG>
"A nata and a mace, and maybe a knife at most! Hunting bears with things like that, <STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE>'s really amazing! 
{PAUSE ""}
　A hunter with a bright future!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just as <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE> had said, she really did hunt with a nata and a mace.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No contradiction there... not really...<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Then, </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="しろざき">Shirozaki</STYLE><STYLE ID="12">-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, do you use a nata and a mace too!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No, no, I'm nothing that grand! 
{PAUSE ""}
　Aside from <STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="8">Chigaya-chan</STYLE>, everybody's only a hair better than your average person with them! 
{PAUSE ""}
　Oh! But I'm good at cutting flies out of the air with a nata! I taught <STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE> once!"<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"That's still plenty amazing!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hahaha! Cutting flies with a nata won't fill your belly!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hmm... Hunting talk wasn't getting me any new information...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Wasn't there some way to bring up the curse-killings naturally?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\手直し・追加\バギー横.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
