<STYLE ID="5">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">! Drive more safely, will you!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Ohohohoho! If you're a Niimura woman, you'd better get used to this much!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
