<STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE>'s buggy shot past at a ridiculous speed, trailing loud laughter.<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Senpaaai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\バギーアイドリング.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
