Then the buggy carrying <STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE> caught up from behind.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The road had gotten wide enough to ride side by side.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バギーと競走.lcm" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "C" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "人物3" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Aww, I really can't beat the buggies!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Beyond them, <STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE> were leaping around among the trees.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Slower than the buggies or not, being able to move like that is really amazing.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "1000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2,人物3,111" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
