{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="しろざき">Shirozaki</STYLE><STYLE ID="12">-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">! This settlement seems like a fun place!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............ 
{PAUSE ""}
That so!? I'm glad if you think so! 
{PAUSE ""}
　If you can take home nothing but fun memories, that'd be the best!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was something a little loaded about that reply.<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Is something going on!? Something bad, maybe!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hmm... Well, yeah. 
{PAUSE ""}
But it's nothing you girls need to worry about, <STYLE ID="9">Natsumi-chan</STYLE>!"<PG>
If there's no lie in that answer, <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="しろざき">Shirozaki</STYLE>-san doesn't know why we came here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The only ones who know are the people of the Niimura family.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see... Everyone in the settlement is a suspect, so they aren't carelessly spreading the word about us...<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Oh, right! Same as </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">the late Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, I have a precognitive ability, only at this time of year! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　If you ever have any trouble, come talk to me!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "1000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\バギーアイドリング.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "800" "0"}
