The buggy I was on braked hard.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The others didn't notice and went on far ahead.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\城崎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="9">Natsumi-chan</STYLE>... I don't know whether what you just said is true or not. 
{PAUSE ""}
But you must never, ever tell anyone else what you just said. 
{PAUSE ""}
Understood?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I knew it...! He reacted to my being able to hear <STYLE ID="3">Ojisan</STYLE>'s voice!<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Uh... Is there something about it...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That power... is a witch's power... 
{PAUSE ""}
If anyone else found out, it would turn into a serious matter. 
{PAUSE ""}
So you must never tell anyone, all right? I'll forget about this too..."<PG>
